        "source_type": "text",
        "source_sentence": "The biodegradability of the copolyesters was investigated through a comparison of the weight loss during the immersion of samples in river water. The samples were put into the river water in polyethylene bottles, and they were held at 37°C for 40 days. The samples were taken out every 10 days and washed with methanol; this was followed by drying in a vacuum oven.",
